+     * answer for compositions that share the live swapchain's format. Windows
+     * are always claimed with the SDR composition, which means a query for one
+     * of the HDR compositions would always fail here and HDR output could never
+     * be enabled at all. Consult the HDR state SDL already tracks for the
+     * display in that case; the color space is verified against the real
+     * swapchain in D3D12_INTERNAL_CreateSwapchain.
